(7) Describing or altering the boundaries of the city, or annexing or de-annexing property;
(8) Establishing or changing the grade, curbline or width of any road, street, public way, alley, avenue or boulevard;
(9) Granting any right, franchise or easement;
(10) Making, amending, or approving any appropriation or budget;
(11) Naming or renaming a park or recreational facility;
(12) Pertaining to any city internal personnel, department or administrative policies;
